1
00:00:02,150 --> 00:00:05,720
Two hundred roles, Hunter. The board
wants your signature by end of
quarter.

2
00:00:07,150 --> 00:00:10,731
<i>Two hundred people. I don't know one
of their names.</i>

3
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:14,642
Start with Design. They're…
sentimental.

4
00:00:15,150 --> 00:00:16,313
Give me two weeks.

5
00:00:16,433 --> 00:00:17,451
For what?

6
00:00:18,150 --> 00:00:21,180
<i>To meet who I'm firing.</i>

7
00:00:21,650 --> 00:00:26,348
<i>Nobody here knows my face. I skipped
every photo shoot. Finally paying off.</i>

8
00:00:30,900 --> 00:00:35,729
Okay, I have to ask. Same protein bar?
Three days running?

9
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:38,455
<i>She's counting. Who counts?</i>

10
00:00:39,150 --> 00:00:42,694
It's got… everything you need.

11
00:00:43,400 --> 00:00:47,079
It's chalk. You're eating chalk in a
wrapper.

12
00:00:47,650 --> 00:00:51,855
<i>New guy. Nice watch. Sad lunch.
Something's off.</i>

13
00:00:52,400 --> 00:00:55,623
Here. My tía always makes too much.
Don't make it weird.

14
00:00:57,400 --> 00:01:01,330
<i>Friday. Promotion review. Do not cry
at your desk, Reyes.</i>

15
00:01:01,900 --> 00:01:04,588
So. Weekend. What'd you do?

16
00:01:05,150 --> 00:01:07,455
Caught up on some… stuff.

17
00:01:07,575 --> 00:01:08,460
Work stuff?

18
00:01:08,580 --> 00:01:09,511
…Yeah.

19
00:01:10,150 --> 00:01:12,291
And the weekend before?

20
00:01:12,411 --> 00:01:13,532
You're doing a thing.

21
00:01:14,150 --> 00:01:16,013
I'm totally doing a thing.

22
00:01:16,650 --> 00:01:19,771
When's the last time you did something
you'd never done before?

23
00:01:21,650 --> 00:01:24,901
<i>Signed a billion-dollar deal in a
parking garage. Doesn't count.</i>

24
00:01:25,650 --> 00:01:27,363
…Define 'something.'

25
00:01:27,483 --> 00:01:30,880
Oh no. You're a project.

26
00:01:31,400 --> 00:01:34,970
<i>Under forty bucks. Fun. Zero protein
bars.</i>

27
00:01:37,650 --> 00:01:40,499
Friday night. My treat. It's a
Groupon, relax.

28
00:01:41,650 --> 00:01:45,038
I'm not really a… I don't really do
stuff.

29
00:01:45,650 --> 00:01:48,636
<i>Say no. You might be firing her
department. Say no.</i>

30
00:01:49,650 --> 00:01:52,134
Yeah. I got that from the chalk.

31
00:01:52,650 --> 00:01:53,696
…Okay.

32
00:01:56,650 --> 00:02:00,297
<i>One date. Then I tell her. Then I fix
this.</i>

33
00:02:02,650 --> 00:02:03,414
<i>Somehow.</i>

34
00:02:07,650 --> 00:02:08,848
There you are! Mr. Co—

35
00:02:09,650 --> 00:02:10,940
<i>Mister… what?</i>
